<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E Q1 net rises to PLN 14.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E Q1 net rises to PLN 14.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW, ( V 5</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal-Export preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			10.55 vs	0.85</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  14.16 vs	6.41</p>
<p>    net profit				14.16 vs	6.41</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal-Export SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 16.50 vs	9.10</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  16.00 vs	9.08</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				  na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     4.07 vs	9.25</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.45 vs	3.69</p>
<p>    investment				 0.31 vs	0.31</p>
<p>-- Polski Serwis +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
